    dcterms:date "2010"^^xsd:gYear ;
    :sourceRef "http://www.bahamasforestry.com/docs/ForestryAct2010.pdf" ;
    :definitionText "(Bahamas 2010) Forest means any area consisting mainly of trees including forest cover, all other vegetation, wetlands, coil and ground beneath it. Bahamas Forestry Act of 2010. http://www.bahamasforestry.com/docs/ForestryAct2010.pdf" .

