    :definitionText "(Bulgaria 2007) For defining forest, in Bulgaria is used the definition in the Forest Act: Forest is area, covered with forest tree species on area not less than 0.1 ha. http://unfccc.int/files/national_reports/initial_reports_under_the_kyoto_protocol/application/msword/initial_report-bulgaria.doc" .

