    :definitionText "(Bulgaria 2013?) Article 2, paragraph 1 of the Law - \"Forest for the purposes of this Act is land occupied by forest vegetation an area not less than 1 ha.\" In practice - any land area greater than 1 ha and a width of not less than 10 m (measured to the width of tree roots). Article 2, paragraph 2 ZGor - \"Forest Fund under this Act is the territory intended primarily for forest covering forests and shrubs, as well as land for afforestation and agricultural land referred to in the cadastre. http:" .

