    :definitionText "(Czech Republic 2006 KP) Cover Min. Area (ha) = 0.05 Min. Crown Cover (%) = 30 Min. Tree Height (m) = 2 Min. Strip Width (m) = 20 http://unfccc.int/files/national_reports/initial_reports_under_the_kyoto_protocol/application/pdf/initial_report_aau_unfccc_cze.pdf. (2006)" .

