    :definitionText "(Denmark 2009 NIR) Crown cover > 10%, tree height > 5m, area > 0.5 ha, width > 10 m. http://afoludata.jrc.ec.europa.eu/metaed/project_collection/JRC_54744_Mascaref_Full_Report_for_print.pdf" .

