:def_Forest_Denmark_nd_002
    rdf:type :Definition ;
    :defines :Forest ;
    :hasCategory :LandCover ;
    :hasJurisdictionLevel :National ;
    :appliesIn :Denmark ;
    :heightMin "6.0"^^xsd:decimal ;
    :areaMin "3.0"^^xsd:decimal ;
    :definitionText "(Denmark) Forest means areas of 3 ha or more with woody plants which may on the site of growth develop into tall standard (above 6 m). Woody plants also include many-stemmed mountain pine. www.mst.dk/rules/Ministerial%20Orders%20no%20longer%20in%20force/Chemicals%20not%20in%20force/05030500.doc" .

