    :appliesIn :Mali ;
    :sourceRef "http://www.un.org/esa/forests/pdf/aheg/aheg1/Mali_E.pdf" ;
    :definitionText "(Mali) Any area of land covered in vegetation of which the exclusive, primary and secondary products are wood, resins, gum, fruits, bamboo, creepers, raffia, or any other plants not classed as agricultural products. http://www.un.org/esa/forests/pdf/aheg/aheg1/Mali_E.pdf" .

:def_Forest_Mauritania_1982_001
    rdf:type :Definition ;
    :defines :Forest ;
    :hasCategory :LandCover ;
    :hasJurisdictionLevel :National ;
    :appliesIn :Mauritania ;
    dcterms:date "1982"^^xsd:gYear ;
    :definitionText "(Mauritania 1982) Sont considérées comme forêts les formations végétales dont les produits princilpaux sont les bois, ou d'autres matières telles aue Ecorce, Tanin, Gomme. ARTICLE 2. LEX-FAOC002244. MAURITANIA: Ordonnance n&ordm; 82-171 portant Code forestier. Date of text: 15 December 1982." .

:def_Forest_Mauritius_1983_001
    rdf:type :Definition ;
